WEBVTT

00:00:02.966 --> 00:00:03.806
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.699 --> 00:00:07.481
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually get up at about seven.

00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:10.488
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:14.338
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I have lectures in the morning every day.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:17.378
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.366 --> 00:00:22.507
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Then I also have tutorials on Thursday afternoon.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:25.648
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:29.204
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually have lunch at the university.

00:00:31.466 --> 00:00:32.377
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.445
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Sometimes I go to a restaurant with my friends.